{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jAfD1KfenR1795644843.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：一股東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。同時，一道雲帶亦覆蓋華南。本港方面，今早市區氣溫降至17度左右，新界再低兩三度。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致多雲，初時有一兩陣微雨。早上清涼。下午部分時間天色明朗，最高氣溫約21度。吹輕微至和緩北至東北風。</p><p></p><p>展望：未來一兩日漸轉天晴，日間氣溫回升，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大，星期六非常乾燥。星期日風勢頗大。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T22:56:56.982539+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T22:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T01:52:05.797762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T22:50:12.239502+00:00","content_hash":"c7599670e5b16c0553057be5366bf76231b10c934ab180e614046502eb91d8ed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T22:56:56.982539+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}